# NestJS Filter Generation Pattern

Use this as the canonical pattern when creating or updating filter files in `src/modules/**/filters`. Do not inspect any other files except entity in the same module.

## Source of Truth

- Read filter fields only from `src/modules/<module>/entities/*.entity.ts` in the same module.
- Include only scalar entity columns (`@Column`, `@PrimaryColumn`).
- Ignore relation properties (`@ManyToOne`, `@OneToMany`, `@OneToOne`, `@ManyToMany`, `@JoinColumn` fields).
- Do not inspect any other files.

## Required Filter File Structure

- File name: `<module>.filter.ts`
- Classes (in order):
  - `<Module>Sorts extends BaseSorts`
  - `<Module>Filters extends BaseFilters`
  - `<Module>Filter extends BaseFilter`
- Required imports:
  - `ApiProperty` from `@nestjs/swagger`
  - `Type` from `class-transformer`
  - validators from `class-validator`
  - `i18nValidationMessage` from `nestjs-i18n`
  - `BaseFilter`, `BaseFilters`, `BaseSorts`, `SortOrders` from `@common/classes/filter`
  - `ValidationErrors` from `@common/constants/validation`
  - `IsSortOrder` from `@common/decorators/sort`

## Mapping Rules

- Sorts: every scalar field gets `@IsSortOrder()` and type `SortOrders`.
- Filters `number` field -> `@IsInt(...)`, `@IsOptional()`, `@ApiProperty({ required: false })`.
- Filters `string` field -> `@IsString(...)`, `@IsOptional()`, `@ApiProperty({ required: false })`.
- Filters `boolean` field -> `@IsBoolean(...)`, `@IsOptional()`, `@ApiProperty({ required: false })`.
- Wrapper class:
  - `filter?: <Module>Filters` with `@ValidateNested()`, `@Type(() => <Module>Filters)`, `@IsOptional()`, `@ApiProperty({ required: false })`
  - `sorts?: <Module>Sorts` with `@ValidateNested()`, `@Type(() => <Module>Sorts)`, `@IsOptional()`, `@ApiProperty({ required: false })`

## Canonical Example (order-category)

Entity source in same module: `entities/order-category.entity.ts`

- Scalar fields:
  - `category_id: number`
  - `category_name: string`
  - `parent_category_id?: number`
  - `order_type_prefix: string`
  - `is_report_excluded: boolean`

```typescript
import { ApiProperty } from '@nestjs/swagger'
import { Type } from 'class-transformer'
import { IsBoolean, IsInt, IsOptional, IsString, ValidateNested } from 'class-validator'
import { i18nValidationMessage } from 'nestjs-i18n'
import { BaseFilter, BaseFilters, BaseSorts, SortOrders } from '@common/classes/filter'
import { ValidationErrors } from '@common/constants/validation'
import { IsSortOrder } from '@common/decorators/sort'

export class OrderCategorySorts extends BaseSorts {
  @IsSortOrder()
  category_id?: SortOrders

  @IsSortOrder()
  category_name?: SortOrders

  @IsSortOrder()
  parent_category_id?: SortOrders

  @IsSortOrder()
  order_type_prefix?: SortOrders

  @IsSortOrder()
  is_report_excluded?: SortOrders
}

export class OrderCategoryFilters extends BaseFilters {
  @IsInt({ message: i18nValidationMessage(ValidationErrors.NUMBER_FORMAT) })
  @IsOptional()
  @ApiProperty({ required: false })
  category_id?: number

  @IsString({ message: i18nValidationMessage(ValidationErrors.STRING_FORMAT) })
  @IsOptional()
  @ApiProperty({ required: false })
  category_name?: string

  @IsInt({ message: i18nValidationMessage(ValidationErrors.NUMBER_FORMAT) })
  @IsOptional()
  @ApiProperty({ required: false })
  parent_category_id?: number

  @IsString({ message: i18nValidationMessage(ValidationErrors.STRING_FORMAT) })
  @IsOptional()
  @ApiProperty({ required: false })
  order_type_prefix?: string

  @IsBoolean({ message: i18nValidationMessage(ValidationErrors.BOOLEAN_FORMAT) })
  @IsOptional()
  @ApiProperty({ required: false })
  is_report_excluded?: boolean
}

export class OrderCategoryFilter extends BaseFilter {
  @ValidateNested()
  @Type(() => OrderCategoryFilters)
  @IsOptional()
  @ApiProperty({ required: false })
  filter?: OrderCategoryFilters

  @ValidateNested()
  @Type(() => OrderCategorySorts)
  @IsOptional()
  @ApiProperty({ required: false })
  sorts?: OrderCategorySorts
}
```
